    "description": "This circular mountain bike route is located on New Wavendon Heath near Woburn in Bedfordshire. The area also has multiple footpaths so it also a fine place for a walk. On the heath you will find miles of woodland trails with lots of wildlife to see. There is a parking area on the southern side of the woods where you can pick up the trail. You can continue your walking in the area at Bow Brickhill or Woburn Abbey Park .",
